    Fix content issues in Ch1-2: broken exercises, typos, terminology
    
    - Remove institution-specific (VMI) references from installation section
    - Fix cwd abbreviation confusion in Command Window section
    - Fix transition text in MATLAB Desktop section
    - Add missing truncated pyramid formula in exercises
    - Replace placeholder exercises with real content (Ch1 and Ch2)
    - Fix broken cardsort in scripts section (add responses to match elements)
    - Fix wrong function name (rectangle_perimeter -> rectangle_properties)
    - Remove duplicate script-vs-function table, replace with xref
    - Fix typos ("is problem" -> "this problem")
    - Add %d format specifier documentation
    - Add factorial hint for Stirling's formula exercise
    
    https://claude.ai/code/session_01ERt9khoWPqjnbTgpRCm2VX

